---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Section from "../components/Section.astro";
import Title from "../components/Title.astro";
import Text from "../components/Text.astro";
---

<Layout title="Legal">
    <main>
        <Section>
            <div style="max-width: 65ch;">
                <Title as="h1">Legal</Title>
                <Text class="mb-12 max-md:mb-8">Last updated: March 2026</Text>

                <Title as="h2">About This Page</Title>
                <Text class="mb-12 max-md:mb-8"
                    >This page covers how Sewmii Pattern Studio handles your data, how purchases work, and how to get in
                    touch if something goes wrong.</Text
                >

                <Title as="h2">Privacy</Title>
                <Text
                    >We don't collect, store, or sell your personal data. Sewmii Pattern Studio does not use sign-up
                    forms, accounts, or any tracking tools that store personally identifiable information.</Text
                >
                <Text
                    >That said, third-party services we rely on may collect basic technical data. Cloudflare, our
                    hosting provider, may log basic traffic data such as IP addresses for security purposes. If you make
                    a purchase, Etsy and Shopee's respective privacy policies apply.</Text
                >
                <Text class="mb-12 max-md:mb-8"
                    >We don't control what these platforms collect. We'd encourage you to read their privacy policies if
                    you have concerns.</Text
                >

                <Title as="h2">Purchases & Refunds</Title>
                <Text
                    >All purchases are currently handled through Etsy and Shopee. By completing a purchase on either
                    platform, you agree to their terms of service and refund policies.</Text
                >
                <Text class="mb-12 max-md:mb-8"
                    >As digital products, sewing patterns are non-refundable once downloaded. If you experience a
                    technical issue with your file — such as a corrupted download or missing pages — contact us and
                    we'll make it right.</Text
                >

                <Title as="h2">Custom Patterns</Title>
                <Text
                    >Custom pattern orders require a 50% deposit upfront before work begins. The remaining balance is
                    due upon completion before the final files are delivered. Payments are made via PayPal.
                </Text>
                <Text class="mb-12 max-md:mb-8">
                    As custom patterns are made specifically for you, they are non-refundable once work has started. If
                    you have concerns at any stage of the process, reach out and we'll work it out together.
                </Text>

                <Title as="h2">Contact</Title>
                <Text>
                    For any questions, issues, or concerns, reach out directly at <a
                        class="underline hover:opacity-65"
                        href="mailto:info.sewmii@gmail.com">info.sewmii@gmail.com</a
                    > or <a
                        class="underline hover:opacity-65"
                        href="https://instagram.com/sewmii.studio"
                        target="_blank">@sewmii.studio</a
                    > on Instagram.
                </Text>
            </div>
        </Section>
    </main>
</Layout>
